{"suttaId":"tha-ap95","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4986,5001],"vripara":"14"},"segments":{"tha-ap95:0.3":"Aḍḍhaceḷakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap95:1.1":"“Tissassāhaṃ bhagavato, upaḍḍhadussamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap95:1.3":"Paramakāpaññapattomhi [paramakāruññapattomhi (syā. ka.)], duggatena [duggandhena (sī.)] samappito.","tha-ap95:2.1":"“Upaḍḍhadussaṃ datvāna, kappaṃ saggamhi modahaṃ;","tha-ap95:2.3":"Avasesesu kappesu, kusalaṃ kāritaṃ mayā.","tha-ap95:3.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ dussamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap95:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dussadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap95:4.1":"“Ekūnapaññāsakappamhi [ekapaññāsakappamhi (syā.)], rājāno cakkavattino;","tha-ap95:4.3":"Samantacchadanā nāma, bāttiṃsāsuṃ [khattiyāsuṃ (syā. ka.)] janādhipā.","tha-ap95:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap95:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā aḍḍhaceḷako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap95:7.1":"Aḍḍhaceḷakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2766,"to":2766,"paras":[{"para":2766,"vripara":"14","refs":["tha-ap95:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>tissassāhaṃ bhagavato</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap95:1"],["tha-ap95:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap95:1.1","tissassāhaṃ bhagavato",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
